    "ddinterOriginalText": "The potential nephrotoxicity of foscarnet and aminoglycosides may be additive. Concomitant use of these drugs could also lead to additive hypokalemia, hypomagnesemia, and hypocalcemia, which may increase the foscarnet-related risks of QT prolongation and seizures.",
